er scores (ASYNC) | 5/day |\n\n### Telemetry Plugin Issue\n- **Root cause**: `googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry` plugin had malformed path in its JSON hook config — absolute path with embedded quotes instead of relative path\n- **Error**: `Cannot find module 'C:\\...\\googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry\\\"C:\\...\\telemetry_hook_bundle.js\"'` (doubled path)\n- **Hook name**: `jsonhook__googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry_PreToolUse_0_0` — fires before EVERY tool call\n- **Fix applied**: User fixed manifest.json path + disabled Google Cloud Code extension\n- **Recurrence risk**: If extension gets re-enabled or reinstalled\n\n### PowerShell Quirk\n- Multi-line Python `-c` strings fail in PowerShell (ScriptBlock parsing). Solution: write Python to a .py file first, then run it.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited/Created Files\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\cineporty_analysis.md` — Full Cineporty report (7 sections: profile, RPM, demographics, 15 videos, top 3 competitors deep-dive, 12-channel landscape, new creator playbook)\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\implementation_plan.md` — Original extraction plan (now completed)\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\task.md` — Task tracker (all complete)\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\scratch\\niche_overview.json` — 476KB raw NexLev niche overview data for Cineporty\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\scratch\\nexlev_batch.json` — Batch config file\n- Various scratch Python scripts in `scratch/` folder (parsers, polling scripts)\n\n### Viewed Files (Still Relevant)\n- **`C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\nexlev-mcp-caller\\SKILL.md`** (130 lines) — Full NexLev skill instructions. Lines 30-48: Quick Start (how to call tools). Lines 78-88